{"sha": "d70205aed950ce601a906bf39aba6c7607ebd0cd30c10845540eec799decb246", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:potential-capacitors} 章 --- 电势；导体与电容器}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:1}", "$V = 8.99 \\times 10^9 \\times 10^{-6}/1 = \\qty{9.0}{kV}$; $W = qV = \\qty{9.0}{mJ}$;", "释放后，$\\tfrac12mv^2 = \\qty{9}{mJ}$：$v = \\sqrt{18} = \\qty{4.2}{m/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:2}", "$E = 100/10^{-3} = \\qty{1e5}{V/m}$; $E_k = eU = \\qty{100}{eV} = \\qty{1.6e-17}{J}$,", "故 $v = \\sqrt{2E_k/m_e} = \\qty{5.9e6}{m/s}$；做匀加速运动，", "$t = 2d/v = \\qty{3.4e-10}{s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:3}", "$E_A = 10/0.002 = \\qty{5}{kV/m}$，$E_B = 10/0.008 = \\qty{1.25}{kV/m}$。电场", "指向电势降低的方向；电子（$q < 0$）", "向相反方向加速，朝 $V$ 增大的方向。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:4}", "$C = 4\\pi\\varepsilon_0R = 1.11 \\times 10^{-10} \\times 0.15 = \\qty{17}{pF}$; $Q = CV =", "\\qty{3.3}{\\micro C}$；$E = V/R = 2 \\times 10^5/0.15 = \\qty{1.3}{MV/m}$。击穿", "发生于 $V = E_{\\max}R = 3 \\times 10^6 \\times 0.15 = \\qty{450}{kV}$ 时 --- 大型装置", "采用大球。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:5}", "圆环上每一元素到该点的距离均为 $\\sqrt{R^2 + z^2}$：$V =", "Q/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\sqrt{R^2 + z^2}$; $E_z = -\\dd V/\\dd z = Qz/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0(R^2 +", "z^2)^{3/2}$。圆盘：$\\dd q = 2\\pi\\sigma a\\,\\dd a$ 的电荷位于距离 $\\sqrt{a^2 + z^2}$ 处：$V =", "\\dfrac{\\sigma}{2\\varepsilon_0}\\displaystyle\\int_0^R\\dfrac{a\\,\\dd a}{\\sqrt{a^2 + z^2}} =", "\\dfrac{\\sigma}{2\\varepsilon_0}\\bigl(\\sqrt{z^2 + R^2} - z\\bigr)$，且 $-\\dd V/\\dd z =", "\\dfrac{\\sigma}{2\\varepsilon_0}\\Bigl(1 - \\dfrac{z}{\\sqrt{z^2 + R^2}}\\Bigr)$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:6}", "$V(r) = V(R) + \\displaystyle\\int_r^R\\dfrac{Qr'\\,\\dd r'}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0R^3} =", "\\dfrac{Q}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0R} + \\dfrac{Q(R^2 - r^2)}{8\\pi\\varepsilon_0R^3} = \\dfrac{Q}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0}", "\\dfrac{3R^2 - r^2}{2R^3}$。金核：$V(0) = 1.5 \\times 8.99 \\times 10^9 \\times 1.26 \\times", "10^{-17}/7 \\times 10^{-15} = \\qty{24}{MV}$：质子到达中心需 \\qty{24}{MeV}，α 粒子", "（$2e$）到达中心需 \\qty{48}{MeV}，触及表面需 \\qty{32}{MeV}。", "卢瑟福的 \\qty{5}{MeV} α 粒子在 $r$ 处折返，此处 $2eV =", "\\qty{5}{MeV}$：$V = \\qty{2.5}{MV}$，$r = \\qty{45}{fm}$ --- 远在", "原子核之外，这正是他的点电荷分析得以奏效的原因。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:7}", "轴线上：$2p/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^3 = 2 \\times 8.99 \\times 10^9 \\times 6.2 \\times 10^{-30}/10^{-27} =", "\\qty{1.1e8}{V/m}$；垂直方向上减半，为 \\qty{5.6e7}{V/m}。力矩 $pE =", "\\qty{6.2e-24}{N.m}$；能量差 $2pE = \\qty{1.2e-23}{J}$ 与 $k_BT =", "\\qty{4.1e-21}{J}$：小 $330$ 倍 --- 净取向仅 $0.1\\%$。", "位于 \\qty{0.3}{nm} 处的钠离子：$E = e/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^2 = \\qty{1.6e10}{V/m}$，$-pE", "= \\qty{-1.0e-19}{J} = \\qty{-0.6}{eV}$，$24\\,k_BT$：水分子", "锁定到离子上 --- 即水合作用。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:8}", "$Q = 4\\pi\\varepsilon_0R^2E = 10^{-4} \\times 3 \\times 10^6/8.99 \\times 10^9 = \\qty{33}{nC}$,", "$V = ER = \\qty{30}{kV}$。两球连接后：$E_1 = V/R_1 = \\qty{0.2}{MV/m}$，", "$E_2 = V/R_2 = \\qty{20}{MV/m} > \\qty{3}{MV/m}$：小球使", "空气电离并泄漏电荷 --- 即尖端效应。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:9}", "$C = \\varepsilon_r\\varepsilon_0S/d = 2.2 \\times 8.85 \\times 10^{-12}/10^{-5} = \\qty{2.0}{\\micro F}$;", "卷绕只改变形状，不改变正对面积：$C$ 不变（若加入第二层薄膜，", "使每片箔两侧均与另一箔片正对，则电容加倍）。", "$W = \\tfrac12 \\times 2 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 400^2 = \\qty{0.16}{J}$。除颤器：", "$Q = 150 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 2000 = \\qty{0.30}{C}$, $W = \\tfrac12CU^2 = \\qty{300}{J}$,", "$P = 300/0.005 = \\qty{60}{kW}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:10}", "(a) $E = Q/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^2$，$U = \\dfrac{Q}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0}\\Bigl(\\dfrac1{R_1} -", "\\dfrac1{R_2}\\Bigr)$，$C = 4\\pi\\varepsilon_0R_1R_2/(R_2 - R_1)$；当 $R_2 - R_1 = d \\ll", "R_1$，$R_1R_2 \\approx R^2$，且 $C \\approx 4\\pi R^2\\varepsilon_0/d = \\varepsilon_0S/d$；当 $R_2 \\to", "\\infty$，$C \\to 4\\pi\\varepsilon_0R_1$。(b) $C/L = 2\\pi\\varepsilon_r\\varepsilon_0/\\ln(b/a) = 2\\pi \\times 2.3", "\\times 8.85 \\times 10^{-12}/\\ln5 = \\qty{79}{pF/m}$，量级正确。(c) $E(a) =", "U/[a\\ln(b/a)] = 1000/(5 \\times 10^{-4} \\times 1.61) = \\qty{1.2}{MV/m}$：低于", "聚乙烯的 \\qty{20}{MV/m}，是安全的；在空气中则将处于临界状态。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:11}", "(a) $W = Q^2/2C = Q^2/8\\pi\\varepsilon_0R$。(b) $R = e^2/8\\pi\\varepsilon_0m_ec^2 = 2.31 \\times", "10^{-28}/(2 \\times 8.19 \\times 10^{-14}) = \\qty{1.4e-15}{m}$（通常所说的“经典", "半径”，$e^2/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0m_ec^2 = \\qty{2.8}{fm}$ 则略去了 $\\tfrac12$）。(c) $W =", "Q^2/2C = Q^2d/2\\varepsilon_0S$ 加倍：$\\Delta W = Q^2d/2\\varepsilon_0S = F\\,d$，其中 $F =", "Q^2/2\\varepsilon_0S = \\sigma^2S/2\\varepsilon_0$，与直接求得的结果一致。(d) 在 $U$ 固定时，$W =", "\\varepsilon_0SU^2/2d$ 减半：$\\Delta W = -W/2$；外力仍做功 $W/2$", "（对 $F = \\varepsilon_0SU^2/2x^2$ 从 $d$ 积分至 $2d$）；两部分合计 $W$，", "回流入电池，此时电荷 $CU/2$ 以", "电压 $U$ 返回电池。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:12}", "(a) 半径为 $r$ 的球带电 $q = Qr^3/R^3$，表面电势为", "$q/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r$；添加球壳 $\\dd q = 3Qr^2\\,\\dd r/R^3$ 需做功 $\\dd W =", "q\\,\\dd q/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r = 3Q^2r^4\\,\\dd r/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0R^6$；积分得 $W =", "3Q^2/20\\pi\\varepsilon_0R$。(b) $Q = 92e = \\qty{1.47e-17}{C}$：$W = 3 \\times 2.17 \\times", "10^{-34}/(20\\pi \\times 8.85 \\times 10^{-12} \\times 7.4 \\times 10^{-15}) = \\qty{1.6e-10}{J}", "= \\qty{990}{MeV}$。(c) 每个碎片：电荷 $Q/2$，半径 $R/2^{1/3}$，", "能量 $\\tfrac14 2^{1/3}W$；两个合计 $2^{1/3}W/2 = 0.63W$：释放", "$0.37 \\times 990 = \\qty{370}{MeV}$。(d) 原子核的“表面张力”：", "两个碎片比一个原子核多出表面，这约需", "\\qty{170}{MeV}；能量平衡接近 \\qty{200}{MeV}，主要以", "两碎片在相互斥力作用下分离飞开的动能", "形式出现。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:potential-capacitors:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 重力 $\\tfrac43\\pi r^3\\rho g$ 向下，阻力 $6\\pi\\eta rv$ 向上，", "浮力 $\\tfrac43\\pi r^3\\rho_{\\text{空气}}g$ 向上 --- 为 $1.2/900 = 0.13\\%$ 的", "重力，可忽略不计。终端速度：$\\tfrac43\\pi r^3\\rho g = 6\\pi\\eta rv_1$，$v_1 =", "2\\rho gr^2/9\\eta$.", ""]}